      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Evaluator Agent\n\nEvaluator Agent decide if whats passing through is good or not if its good its fine , but if not then going to optimized and then send back to evaluator for more evaluation . And this is endless loop until the evaluator agent says its good and then only send it off \n\nSimilar to Human in Loop (video on Youtube) similar to it providing feedback and we were the ones bascially deciding if it was good to go or not . But in this agent that does that , were its optimizing all your workflows on the back end without you being in the loop \n",
